probe_h2o_frozen_virtual: H2O RHF/6-31G, active MOs 2-10 out of 13. THE POINT OF
THIS JOB: it is the only probe with frozen VIRTUALS. Every other job here, and
every committed test fixture, windows to the top of the MO space, so nfv is
always 0 and the frozen-virtual path has never been exercised against real
output. Expect ncore = 1, nact = 9, nfv = 3, and eri_act to expand to 9^4 = 6561
elements -- if it comes back 13^4 = 28561 then Window did not restrict the
transformation and every conclusion from the other jobs needs rechecking.

